        {
          "_key": "k00149",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Ms. Paulette and Millville"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0014b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before opening our center in Vineland, Ms. Paulette cared for children in Millville for many years. Families who have known her since then still bring their children to her, and some now bring their grandchildren. One grandmother wrote that Ms. Paulette \"has been watching my grand children throughout the years.\""
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0014d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Worth the short drive"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0014f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Our center at 30 W Chestnut Ave in Vineland is about a 15-minute drive from Millville. Most Millville families drive north on Delsea Drive (Route 47) into Vineland and turn onto W Chestnut Ave. For Millville parents who work in Vineland, it's right on the way. And because we're open "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Monday to Saturday, 6 am to 11 pm"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014h",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", you can find care for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0014i"
          ],
          "text": "early, evening and Saturday shifts"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
