        {
          "_key": "k0014m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "School-age kids from Millville"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014n",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k0014o",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many Millville children go to Millville Public Schools elementary schools such as Rieck Avenue, Mount Pleasant or Silver Run Elementary. Bus routes are set by the district, so ask whether a stop in Vineland is possible. Our "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0014p"
          ],
          "text": "after school program"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0014r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is open until 11 pm, with homework help on every shift and dinner at 6 pm."
