  "excerpt": "Ms. Paulette has cared for Millville children for years. Our Vineland center is about 15 minutes away.",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "_key": "k0006b",
      "_type": "faqItem",
      "answer": "Our center is in Vineland at 30 W Chestnut Ave, about a 15-minute drive from Millville up Delsea Drive. Many of our families come from Millville.",
      "question": "Is your center in Millville?"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0006c",
      "_type": "faqItem",
      "answer": "Bus routes are set by each school district, so ask Millville Public Schools whether a stop in Vineland is possible. School buses can pick up and drop off at our center, and parents can always drop off and pick up here.",
      "question": "Will my child's Millville school bus stop at your center?"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0006d",
      "_type": "faqItem",
      "answer": "Yes. Millville and Vineland are both in Cumberland County, and we accept NJ childcare subsidy (CCAP) for families who qualify.",
      "question": "Can I use CCAP if I live in Millville?"
    }
  ],
